{"id": "c27de2ca-ed9c-41c7-beae-a5a2de0567ba", "slug": "charting-uncharted-galaxies", "title": "Charting Uncharted Galaxies", "description": "Charting Uncharted Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Charting Uncharted Galaxies\"\ndescription: \"Charting Uncharted Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FCD34D\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#0E264B\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#0E264B\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Charting Uncharted Galaxies\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 40; favorites: 21; remixes: 2.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nCharting Uncharted Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNova Initiatives Vision Technology Crew Engage Comm Charting Uncharted Galaxies Partner with leading astrophysicists and engineers, pioneer groundbreaking technologies, and navigate the expanding frontier of deep space.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Charting Uncharted Galaxies.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FCD34D, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #0E264B, background #FFFFFF, surface #0E264B, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Charting Uncharted Galaxies</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body style=\"background-color: #030712; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; overflow-x: hidden;\" class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Subtle Diagonal Background Texture -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.015]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 40px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Radial Gradient Overlay to enhance space atmosphere -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(14, 38, 75, 0.4) 0%, rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.9) 70%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 border-x border-white/[0.04]\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-6 border-b border-white/[0.08]\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-white hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity font-geist\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:square-alt-arrow-right-linear\" style=\"color: #FCD34D;\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                Nova\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-white/60\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Initiatives</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Vision</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Technology</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Crew</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- CTA Button with Corner Brackets -->\n            <button class=\"relative px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-transparent hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors group font-geist\">\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-l border-white/40 group-hover:border-white transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-t border-r border-white/40 group-hover:border-white transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-l border-white/40 group-hover:border-white transition-colors\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 border-b border-r border-white/40 group-hover:border-white transition-colors\"></span>\n                Engage Comm\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex items-center w-full py-20 lg:py-0\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-3xl pt-12 md:pt-24 lg:pt-0\">\n                <h1 class=\"reveal-text text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[5.5rem] leading-[1.05] mb-8 text-white/95 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">\n                    Charting Uncharted Galaxies\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-white/60 max-w-lg mb-12 font-light leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                    Partner with leading astrophysicists and engineers, pioneer groundbreaking technologies, and navigate the expanding frontier of deep space.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start sm:items-center\">\n                    <button class=\"px-7 py-3.5 bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors font-geist\">\n                        Join Initiative\n                    </button>\n\n                    <button class=\"relative px-7 py-3.5 text-sm text-white bg-transparent hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-colors group font-geist\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-white/30 group-hover:border-white/70 transition-colors\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-white/30 group-hover:border-white/70 transition-colors\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-white/30 group-hover:border-white/70 transition-colors\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-white/30 group-hover:border-white/70 transition-colors\"></span>\n                        View Findings\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Info Section -->\n        <footer class=\"w-full pb-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-end justify-between gap-12 mt-auto\">\n\n            <!-- Partners -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 w-full lg:w-auto\">\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-white/60 font-light font-geist\">Trusted by cosmic pioneers across the globe</p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 opacity-50 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight font-geist\">Nexus</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1 font-geist\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-linear\"></iconify-icon> Zenith</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tighter lowercase font-geist\">astro.</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight italic font-geist\">Orbital</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Stats Box with Subtle Gradient Border -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-auto min-w-[320px] md:min-w-[500px] p-8 bg-[#0a0a0a]/40 backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40\"></span>\n                <span class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40\"></span>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight font-geist\">500+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-geist\">Active explorers in network</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight font-geist\">45+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-geist\">Live deep space missions</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight font-geist\">120+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-geist\">Discoveries mapped this year</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Animation ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word) => {\n                    const wordContainer = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordContainer.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wordContainer.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wordContainer.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                    wordContainer.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                    wordContainer.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent descender clipping\n\n                    const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerSpan.innerText = word;\n\n                    wordContainer.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                    el.appendChild(wordContainer);\n                });\n\n                gsap.fromTo(el.querySelectorAll('span > span'),\n                    { y: '120%', rotation: 5, transformOrigin: \"0% 100%\" },\n                    { y: '0%', rotation: 0, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.04, ease: \"power4.out\", delay: 0.2 }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // Fade in other elements\n            gsap.from(\"p, button, footer > div\", {\n                y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"power2.out\", delay: 0.8\n            });\n            gsap.from(\"header\", {\n                y: -20, opacity: 0, duration: 1, ease: \"power2.out\"\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js Globe Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        // Setup Camera\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.z = 25;\n        camera.position.y = 2; // Look slightly down\n\n        // Setup Renderer\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Texture Loader\n        const textureLoader = new THREE.TextureLoader();\n        // Using high-res public textures commonly used for ThreeJS examples to match the realistic reference\n        const earthTexture = textureLoader.load('https://unpkg.com/three-globe/example/img/earth-blue-marble.jpg');\n        const bumpMap = textureLoader.load('https://unpkg.com/three-globe/example/img/earth-topology.png');\n        const specularMap = textureLoader.load('https://unpkg.com/three-globe/example/img/earth-water.png');\n\n        // Create Earth Sphere\n        const geometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(12, 64, 64);\n        const material = new THREE.MeshPhongMaterial({\n            map: earthTexture,\n            bumpMap: bumpMap,\n            bumpScale: 0.15,\n            specularMap: specularMap,\n            specular: new THREE.Color('grey'),\n            shininess: 35\n        });\n\n        const earth = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        // Position earth in center-background\n        earth.position.set(0, -2, -5);\n        scene.add(earth);\n\n        // Atmosphere Glow (Inner)\n        const atmosphereGeometry = new THREE.SphereGeometry(12.2, 64, 64);\n        const atmosphereMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x00aaff,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.15,\n            side: THREE.BackSide,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n        const atmosphere = new THREE.Mesh(atmosphereGeometry, atmosphereMaterial);\n        earth.add(atmosphere);\n\n        // Lighting\n        const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.1);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n        const directionalLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1.2);\n        // Position light to create the terminator line as seen in reference\n        directionalLight.position.set(5, 3, 5);\n        scene.add(directionalLight);\n\n        // Stars Background\n        const starsGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const starsMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            color: 0xffffff,\n            size: 0.05,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.8,\n            sizeAttenuation: true\n        });\n\n        const starsVertices = [];\n        for (let i = 0; i < 3000; i++) {\n            const x = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(200);\n            const y = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(200);\n            const z = THREE.MathUtils.randFloatSpread(200) - 50; // Keep stars behind mostly\n            starsVertices.push(x, y, z);\n        }\n\n        starsGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(starsVertices, 3));\n        const starField = new THREE.Points(starsGeometry, starsMaterial);\n        scene.add(starField);\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const animate = function () {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Subtle rotation\n            earth.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n            starField.rotation.y += 0.0001;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        };\n\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', onWindowResize, false);\n        function onWindowResize() {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        }\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "charting-uncharted-galaxies.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/charting-uncharted-galaxies.jpg", "source_name": "charting-uncharted-galaxies-DESIGN.md", "views": 147, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:00:42.567798+00:00"}